<title>USA: First Home it sets 4-for-3 stock split.</title>
<headline>First Home it sets 4-for-3 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSVILLE, N.J. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Home Bancorp Inc said on Wednesday that it has set a four-for-three stock split and declared a quarterly dividend of $0.10 a share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid after giving effect to the stock split, reflecting an 11 percent increase for shareholders from the new shares to be issued, First Home said. The prior dividend rate was $0.12 a share.</p>
<p>The shares and cash dividend will be paid February 14, 1997, to shareholders of record on January 22, 1997, the company said.  </p>
<p>First Home said its outstanding shares will increase by 33 percent to more than 2.7 million shares.</p>
